{title: 026 - Praise the Lord! You Heavens Adore Him}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #026 • AN DIE FREUDE • 9.7.8.7.8.6.8.7}
{lyricist: Edward Osler}
{composer: Hymn to Joy, Berlin}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 26}
{meta: tune AN DIE FREUDE}
{meta: meter 9.7.8.7.8.6.8.7}
{meta: category Worship - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]Praise the [F/A]Lord: you [C]heavens, [F]adore Him;
[F/A]Praise Him, [Bb]angels in the [F/C]height;
[C]Sun and [F]moon, [C]rejoice [F/A]before [C]Him;
[C]praise Him, [F]all you stars of light.
[F/A]Praise the [Bb]Lord, for He has [F/C]spoken;
[C]worlds His mighty voice [F]obeyed.
[Dm]Laws [Gm]which never [C]shall be [F]broken
[Dm]for their guidance [C]He has made.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C]Praise the [F/A]Lord! for [C]He is [F]glorious;
[F/A]never [Bb]shall His promise [F/C]fail.
[C]God has [F]made [C]His saints [F/A]victorious;
[C]sin and [F]death shall not prevail.
[F/A]Praise the [Bb]God of our salvation!
[C]hosts on high, His power proclaim.
[Dm]Heaven [Gm]and earth [C]and all [F]creation,
[Dm]laud and magnify [C]His Name.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[C]Worship, [F/A]honor, [C]glory, [F]blessing,
[F/A]Lord, we [Bb]offer as our [F/C]gift.
[C]Young and [F]old, [C]Your praise [F/A]expressing,
[C]Our glad [F]songs to You we lift.
[F/A]All the [Bb]saints in heaven [F/C]adore You;
[C]we would join their glad acclaim;
[Dm]As [Gm]Your angels [C]serve before [Am/E]You,
[Dm]so on earth we [C]praise Your name.
{end_of_verse}
